---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About — Adrian" description="About Adrian, an ML/AI Engineer focused on machine learning, data, systems, and practical engineering.">
<section class="page"><div class="eyebrow">/ about</div><h1>I build with data.<br/><em>I think in systems.</em></h1><div class="cols"><div><p class="big">I'm Adrian, an ML/AI Engineer focused on building practical systems with machine learning, data, and code.</p><p>I care about the whole path from an idea to something that actually works: understanding the data, choosing the right approach, writing reliable code, testing assumptions, and measuring the result.</p><p>My interests sit at the intersection of machine learning, AI, systems, and the tools that make technical work faster and more reproducible. I like experiments, useful abstractions, and learning by building.</p></div><aside><div><span>focus</span><b>Machine Learning · AI · Data</b></div><div><span>building with</span><b>Python · Linux · Git · Cloud</b></div><div><span>approach</span><b>Build · Experiment · Measure · Ship</b></div></aside></div></section>
</Layout>
<style>.page{padding:110px 0}.page h1{font-size:clamp(50px,7vw,88px);line-height:.98;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:22px 0 80px}.page h1 em{color:var(--lime);font-style:normal}.cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:100px;max-width:1050px}.cols p{color:#aeb4ad;line-height:1.8;font-size:16px}.cols .big{font-size:25px;color:#f2f3ed;line-height:1.45}.cols aside{border-left:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:30px}.cols aside div{padding:0 0 24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.cols aside span{display:block;font:10px 'JetBrains Mono';color:var(--lime);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}.cols aside b{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}@media(max-width:800px){.page{padding:80px 0}.cols{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px}.cols aside{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:30px 0 0}}
</style>
